  "notes": "Single navy ink colour (#202269) for all text on a pale periwinkle page (#eef1f9) with near-white tiles (#f7f8fc), 16px radii and hairline borders, no shadows. KPI tiles are arranged in descending size rows: 4 wide count tiles, 3 currency tiles, 6 small status-count tiles. The only colour accents are the red Overdue count and green 'Paid' pills. 'Version 2.4.1' is shown as a KPI tile, which is unusual. The More menu is a native details/summary dropdown (closed in the capture) with Products/Settings/Users/Logout. Invoice numbers in the table link to detail pages; stat tiles are not links."
